{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An\u00a0<strong>incremental adventure packed with tons of content and progression.</strong>\u00a0Every battle, you will unlock a new way to defeat hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes all the main features of the game, including the skill tree, loot and items, and skills system. The full game adds Shiny monsters, Archer, Mining, Achievements, and many more features to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032880/extras/99d84905a822cef473b59fb245f87629.poster.avif?t=1758642703\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032880/extras/99d84905a822cef473b59fb245f87629.webm?t=1758642703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032880/extras/99d84905a822cef473b59fb245f87629.mp4?t=1758642703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Skill Tree</strong>: Every node matters, unlock meaningful stats, not just a boring +1 damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Items</strong>: Defeat enemies to earn rare items that dramatically boost your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: Acquire and upgrade a variety of skills to eliminate your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shiny Monsters\u00a0(Full Game):</strong>\u00a0Encounter rare Shiny variants that  grant special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer\u00a0(Full Game)</strong>: Unlock the loyal Archer, who leaps into battle to automatically slay monsters at your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining\u00a0(Full Game):\u00a0</strong>\u00a0Gather ores and refine gems to customize and enhance your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/28aea127ce69926d8282b00b35565912bd23e729.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/e865b65cb9fb954d7403c1b0ca3776941a5b801b.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/12e5d6eed2169767f39f4ed28768e3ddb4ddb49c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/b8042e391aa794d9ed163ecd6eb1a257ade65562.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/08bc3d9c2ba8a6ccf6b17ee846bfc01d818a59af.jpg"},{"name":"Level 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/d8bedf3f64dc1a688e34a6c2e65e029921afeb5a.jpg"},{"name":"Demo Finisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032880/bdcd41357429452644f0cffe2db48a1e779f12c7.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032880?t=1758642703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032880?t=1758642703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032880/e5600e8763bb3ca4f1605fc4a2d7eec90932b2b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758642703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032880/e5600e8763bb3ca4f1605fc4a2d7eec90932b2b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758642703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":